---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
interface Props { heading?: boolean }
const { heading = true } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="reveal">
  {heading && <SectionHead eyebrow="Meet George" title="55 seconds on how I work" sub="A quick silent walkthrough: the problem I solve, who I am and the tools I use. Captions are on the slides." />}
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface shadow-[0_30px_70px_-35px_var(--glow)] aspect-video" data-intro-video>
    <video class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/video/george-intro-poster.webp" aria-label="George Melody intro video, 55 seconds, no audio">
      <source src="/video/george-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      Your browser can't play this video. <a href="/video/george-intro.mp4">Download it</a>.
    </video>
    <button type="button" class="intro-play absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-black/10 hover:bg-transparent transition-colors" aria-label="Play the intro video">
      <span class="grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-bg shadow-xl"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <details class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer text-link">Read the video as text</summary>
    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
      <p>Business should not pause when your team gets busy.</p>
      <p>Missed leads, manual work and disconnected tools slow a business down. George builds automations and AI agents that fix them.</p>
      <p>George M., AI Automation and AI Agent Developer. 100% Job Success, Top Rated on Upwork, 30 jobs completed, $10K+ earned.</p>
      <p>Tools used daily: n8n, Make.com, GoHighLevel, Retell AI, Vapi and more.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-intro-video]').forEach((box) => {
    const v = box.querySelector('video');
    const b = box.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.intro-play');
    if (!v || !b) return;
    b.addEventListener('click', () => { b.hidden = true; v.play().catch(() => { b.hidden = false; }); });
    v.addEventListener('pause', () => { if (v.ended) b.hidden = false; });
    v.addEventListener('ended', () => { b.hidden = false; v.load(); });
  });
</script>
